{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_title", "source_sha256": "59fdf21c7ad6e8512bc349ee8bfb15d4044413af24140b2e367045c9d2ca0022", "ja": "聖炎を宿して", "zh": "怀宿圣炎", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "25ac3206788eb8ab783006653afc7c5537b2897ad5ed30b6abf193908d297413", "ja": "公演前のイメージトレーニングは\nバッチリ！　自信をもって\nステージへ向かおうとする、\nアイドルたちのひと幕です。", "zh": "公演前的形象训练\n完美无缺！这是偶像们\n信心十足地准备走上舞台时的\n一个片段。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ee51cb7d47c3c4b6e32c2ac62e436dfce15011beb4913ccc88918ac7ed5e474d", "ja": "（もうすぐ公演が始まる。そろそろ集合時間だけど、\nメインの真とひなたの姿が見えないな……ん？）", "zh": "（公演马上就要开始了。差不多到集合时间了，可是作为主角的真和日向还没见到人……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "46a1927dd0d8d6740416ebbed09738cd75e09579df725f16b55f56526a555545", "ja": "えいっ……！　とうっ……！　やぁ……！", "zh": "嘿——！……哈！……呀——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "4eb9c0b6ef24fc2386c6cf6deaa27a2e20342aad57f9768d1b1d7c4ba717a949", "ja": "んしょっ……！　とりゃあっ……！　どっこいせ……！", "zh": "嗯咻……！嘿呀……！嘿哟……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e38e632fd13acf1b3e37d36eb103b9494d5fb133bd525dea481b477569e517fd", "ja": "なんだ！？\n妙にリズミカルなふたりの声が聞こえてくる……。", "zh": "怎么回事！？\n听到了两个格外有节奏的声音……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "5f1f34046b8fb8d2be438a30b1a4780d6658328719f94020120820a68c57786d", "ja": "よーし、到着だね、ひなた！", "zh": "好～的，我们到了呢，日向！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "e6ee0a548710bbca32be6d162b8b88cf556456778ee49776b741060297c3110f", "ja": "ふう～。けっこう大変だったねぇ、真さん。", "zh": "呼——还挺不容易的呢，真。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ee98eef161912abe0bb2d97a3b841499920b40ebbcf791c9315928bd3672ced2", "ja": "真！　ひなた！", "zh": "真！　日向！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "b4f72dd529d66c3aa2e9783f9772bb83c3e70155d10ef41a9f66c787532b2c3c", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}、お疲れさまです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "80a3075ee0d583f14203a63ff3b0e50378c75a859a565a8562defc2329c1b213", "ja": "{$P$}、お待たせしちゃったかい？", "zh": "{$P$}，让你久等了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8891799b57ebbd4eeeab8cf4261455e3b783ba02610b086908a80bb93b9c5aa2", "ja": "いや、時間は余裕あるから平気だけど……\nそれより、今の掛け声はいったい……？", "zh": "不，我时间还很充裕，没关系……\n话说回来，刚才那声喊叫到底是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "71de9c7b26d78ff17112f154778ce32e19eed5e83b271496666dd8a3b5c603aa", "ja": "この衣装、お姫様で騎士様っしょや？　ナイトは\nチェスだと、斜めに動くって聞いたもんでねぇ。", "zh": "这套服装，是公主和骑士，对吧？我听说骑士在国际象棋里是斜着走的，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "4aee6f7537f346aadd07a1fd4cc0166c4d3468585d58f96aaf33e38f4e0e9b58", "ja": "だからひなたと、ナイトになりきったつもりで、\n斜め跳びでここまで来たんです！", "zh": "所以我就把自己当成骑士，和日向一起用斜着跳的方式来到这里了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8e02ccbd852b6faff66f5fda5389614f824e5c79b28a3cc5bb2ccf0bc7bd35a5", "ja": "な、なるほど。\nその様子だと、衣装は気に入ったみたいだな。", "zh": "原、原来如此。\n看样子，你似乎很喜欢这套服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "0dd4cf501cd9837ea67b5ef36d1d9c19a53d2e0525b6d673638acd6e4495fe3e", "ja": "はい！　すっごくカワイイ衣装で、\n気合いが入りました！", "zh": "是的！穿上这么可爱的服装，我一下子干劲十足了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "3d6950710e38e82bad85553e848356c4f888910cb63f05bf7a2dc896f9e44e3e", "ja": "それにしても、あたしと真さんがねえ……。\nほんとに、いいんだろか？", "zh": "话说回来，我和真小姐居然……  \n真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "d5d6fb8d50cac7f1f2a686844d98d1346a5a52aad1cde75008b4cd912aa789ad", "ja": "え？　いいって何が？", "zh": "咦？说什么可以？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "a11eb3f2628cf0688a95e0a46c676ea123b32cd248129f236c5fc274daa503d3", "ja": "え？　だから、えっと……。", "zh": "诶？所以，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "4ab5af579fe31c0d9bc4eb1b6e5fe7da0abe53e832707005787ae622da2482ea", "ja": "マコト、ヒナタ、おまたせ～！\nわ～！　ふたりとも、すっごくいい感じだネ！", "zh": "真、小雏，久等啦～！\n哇～！你们两个看起来都超棒的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "76a098e66a9093acd3e6f63d5e9395b1fb4e49adfcac63d464957d5bebf7a4bc", "ja": "ありがとう、エレナ！", "zh": "谢谢你，艾莲娜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "0b546e5a374ef7b048485ea19a6fdeff77f9b70c4d6f17d977046d9c0a1c7aa2", "ja": "めっちゃいいよ！　{$P$}って、\nやっぱセンスいいよね。", "zh": "超棒的！{$P$}，\n你真的很会取名字耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "106bf413e7b275380ab14651acd526ee78a8a0cd92c854752534be6432896d23", "ja": "俺はテーマを決めただけだよ。\nそれに、思った以上の出来ばえだしな！", "zh": "我只是定了个主题而已。\n而且，成果比我想象的还要好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "057a7009f890c3a1e0591e87f8ac3290143494da80104914ea14a6bba427265a", "ja": "エレナも恵美も、さっきからテンションが高くて……\n本番前なんだから、すこしは落ち着きなさい？", "zh": "艾蕾娜和惠美从刚才开始就一直情绪高涨……\n马上就要正式上场了，稍微冷静一点，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1022_037nao", "source_sha256": "d6853563a08ae82fb2148dce424ceeacde13ba563dbb917f1c12478082dde6b1", "ja": "それはしゃあないと思うわ、律子。\n私も新しい衣装は、テンション上がるもん♪", "zh": "我觉得那也没办法啦，律子。\n我穿上新衣服也会兴奋起来嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1023_009rit", "source_sha256": "ddcc49da742c9a99ea6c7e232593348c373fdd08079af516782ac018fb8ca7f1", "ja": "もう、奈緒まではしゃいじゃって。\nそういえば、真とひなたも……。", "zh": "真是的，连奈绪都兴奋起来了。说起来，真和日向也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1024_006mak", "source_sha256": "c70f3b5f3659bfbe39ce52a209edb5a713e3371b496b7d62fbd89c422250b7fb", "ja": "ボクたちは、ナイトを意識して斜めに移動してただけ！\n意外とハードだったし、いい準備運動になったかな。", "zh": "我们只是为了配合骑士的形象，特意斜着移动而已！\n意外地挺累人的，正好算是做了热身运动吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1025_037nao", "source_sha256": "6b9526df9b51004cb7a9143972b36b121e7eaf630194f31209728e1d7057a88c", "ja": "さすが真！　はしゃいでるように見えて、\nちゃんと考えとるんやな～。", "zh": "不愧是真！看起来像是在玩闹，其实一直都有好好动脑筋嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1026_006mak", "source_sha256": "a5baab32ced38ff170514bfb461a9ed1b221b219cd8af13d9953aecfb0b052fc", "ja": "ううん。\nボクじゃなくて、ひなたのアイディアなんだ！", "zh": "嗯，不是我。是日向的主意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "7d658e198ecd001497886736edad21320d630641d767122cb84c2f27507fb20a", "ja": "へーっ、ひなたが！？　なんか意外だね？", "zh": "诶——是日向！？感觉真让人意外呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1028_035hin", "source_sha256": "b3e01b5ecca544a5bb55864ab830391d5ae0beead5c6b490b8a91cc233f03fa6", "ja": "あ、うん……えへへ。あたしは、\n真さんみたいにかっこよくないからねぇ。", "zh": "啊，嗯……嘿嘿。因为我不像真小姐那样帅气嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1029_035hin", "source_sha256": "00e330d850a37ee3cbcb31e8b4e05d5570e83d7442734dc5d34cd88f0fcbf09a", "ja": "だから、ちょっこしでもナイトらしく、カッコよく\n見える方法がないかなぁって、考えたんだべさ。", "zh": "所以我就想啊，有没有什么办法，哪怕只是一点点，也能让自己看起来更像骑士、更帅气呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1030_018ele", "source_sha256": "93a9f37fc7d3dc762d30dd8965da2e7ef1b57e7300bd5840723a01fb61ac96a1", "ja": "カッコよくない？　ワタシは今のヒナタ、\nすっごくカッコいいと思うけどナ……？", "zh": "不是很帅吗？我觉得现在的小日向，特别帅气啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1031_006mak", "source_sha256": "f4a31e30b8e2ab769a05e5f1d241984a5ffe5f543236fc1c9cd7bdd7b092e74d", "ja": "うん。ボクも、すっごくかっこいいと思う！", "zh": "嗯，我也觉得现在的小日向帅极了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1032_035hin", "source_sha256": "9346a5782d757b9f0bc57ecc88e54620fb51f60cfe8d8d82dee4c9b0750a4fc4", "ja": "ええっ！？　そ、そうかねぇ。\nなんだか、照れるけども……。", "zh": "诶！？是、是这样吗……\n总觉得有点害羞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1033_035hin", "source_sha256": "96d7914f2c50362e5051d22c7dfa21b6c66c9a42d3e46a18f0a1f421f999affe", "ja": "でも、せっかくほめてもらえたんだから……\nそれを自信にして、がんばるべさ！", "zh": "不过，难得被你夸奖了……\n我会把这份夸奖化作自信，继续努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1034_p", "source_sha256": "52c0975196f1de0c128c76b31b2d76de91ae692564b470a8f569edec35659f04", "ja": "うん、みんないい表情だ。\nその熱意を、そのままステージにぶつけてきてくれ！", "zh": "嗯，大家的表情都很棒。\n就把这股热情，原原本本地释放在舞台上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1035_006mak", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1036_035hin", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1037_009rit", "source_sha256": "2df36b34dd6bcf9447ba44fd19651899046ba39c1d862a1ce50616abc6f726a3", "ja": "ええ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1038_018ele", "source_sha256": "e9c9ccb847b62c91c032be1372eff20be8babf6148ca4370e4419fcbe46d4219", "ja": "ハーイ！", "zh": "好的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1039_020meg", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_113_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_113_fc_01_1040_037nao", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
